(7288445, 1136051, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice view and use of the chair.  I both like and dislike the car in this image.  It shows that this is a vantage point that is distant from his home so adds to it.  On the other hand the man and the vista are very interesting and the car is less so.</td>', 'Nice view and use of the chair.  I both like and dislike the car in this image.  It shows that this is a vantage point that is distant from his home so adds to it.  On the other hand the man and the vista are very interesting and the car is less so.', '2014-11-29 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288447, 1136086, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love all the textures.  I think a slight tilt (camera higher) would have added some depth to the seat.</td>', 'Love all the textures.  I think a slight tilt (camera higher) would have added some depth to the seat.', '2014-11-29 20:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288448, 1135993, 91496, '<td valign="top">I love to colors and the vanishing point.  How did is look without the glass -- it may have been more interesting, as the glass blocks the view of the end of the path.</td>', 'I love to colors and the vanishing point.  How did is look without the glass -- it may have been more interesting, as the glass blocks the view of the end of the path.', '2014-11-29 20:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288449, 1135779, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute pooch.  I always take the collar off (if it was a planned photo) when I shoot my dog.</td>', 'Cute pooch.  I always take the collar off (if it was a planned photo) when I shoot my dog.', '2014-11-29 20:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288451, 1136013, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the dogs pose.  Might be a bit cluttered and not focused on any one subject.</td>', 'I like the dogs pose.  Might be a bit cluttered and not focused on any one subject.', '2014-11-29 20:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288452, 1135991, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely scene and processed.  I like the mood here.</td>', 'Nicely scene and processed.  I like the mood here.', '2014-11-29 20:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288453, 1136003, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice effect here.  I like the shadows and lighting.  The tower is perhaps a little too bright.</td>', 'Nice effect here.  I like the shadows and lighting.  The tower is perhaps a little too bright.', '2014-11-29 20:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288455, 1135747, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  I like the figure by the shore. The chairs may be to secondary of a subject for a chairs challenge.</td>', 'Nice scene.  I like the figure by the shore. The chairs may be to secondary of a subject for a chairs challenge.', '2014-11-29 20:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288456, 1136054, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the framing here with the chairs on either side.  It is a little noisy, which sometimes works but I find it a bit distracting.  Also not sure if the horizontals and verticals are level.</td>', 'I like the framing here with the chairs on either side.  It is a little noisy, which sometimes works but I find it a bit distracting.  Also not sure if the horizontals and verticals are level.', '2014-11-29 20:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288457, 1136011, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the image.  Bold colors and great textures.  The chairs are somewhat secondary.</td>', 'I like the image.  Bold colors and great textures.  The chairs are somewhat secondary.', '2014-11-29 20:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288458, 1135974, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting story with the man and the dog.  Could just crop to the right half.  Not sure the chair connection to the rest of the image is strong.</td>', 'Interesting story with the man and the dog.  Could just crop to the right half.  Not sure the chair connection to the rest of the image is strong.', '2014-11-29 20:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288459, 1136082, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic character of this.  Bold decision to blow out most of the lake/ocean - not sure it works for me.</td>', 'I like the graphic character of this.  Bold decision to blow out most of the lake/ocean - not sure it works for me.', '2014-11-29 20:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288460, 1135969, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great story here, with the man in the city hospital.  Not sure the chair connection is as strong as the man, balloon, plant or cityscape being the main subjects.</td>', 'Great story here, with the man in the city hospital.  Not sure the chair connection is as strong as the man, balloon, plant or cityscape being the main subjects.', '2014-11-29 20:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288461, 1135905, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very cool graphical set up.  I like all the wood textures here.  Lighting is perhaps a bit odd (or is that a hard vignette).  A bit more space at the edges of the frame would help the composition.  Wide white border distracts rather than helps.</td>', 'Very cool graphical set up.  I like all the wood textures here.  Lighting is perhaps a bit odd (or is that a hard vignette).  A bit more space at the edges of the frame would help the composition.  Wide white border distracts rather than helps.', '2014-11-29 20:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
