(7289016, 1135969, 103032, '<td valign="top">Evocative.  Something comforting of one''s favorite chair...<br/>I like everything about this; the composition, the candidness of the gentleman, his gaze out the window, the B&amp;W processing.  This image has a story.<br/>I would hope this would ribbon, my top pick.</td>', 'Evocative.  Something comforting of one''s favorite chair...I like everything about this; the composition, the candidness of the gentleman, his gaze out the window, the B&W processing.  This image has a story.I would hope this would ribbon, my top pick.', '2014-12-02 04:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289018, 1135960, 114285, '<td valign="top">hehe, love the title, and the photo is not so bad also :)</td>', 'hehe, love the title, and the photo is not so bad also :)', '2014-12-02 05:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289019, 1136066, 114285, '<td valign="top">Loving the lensbaby, great effect and processing.</td>', 'Loving the lensbaby, great effect and processing.', '2014-12-02 05:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
