(7289125, 1135974, 13077, '<td valign="top">The strong diagonal theme and perfect spacing between the three is excellent. Combined with a super cool setting and great exposure and contrast - 10 from me.</td>', 'The strong diagonal theme and perfect spacing between the three is excellent. Combined with a super cool setting and great exposure and contrast - 10 from me.', '2014-12-02 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7289134, 1136077, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice. The background looks almost like a painting and it''s well composed and elegant with the way the bird is perched up there.</td>', 'Nice. The background looks almost like a painting and it''s well composed and elegant with the way the bird is perched up there.', '2014-12-02 13:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
