(7289136, 1136021, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like how out-of-place the chairs seem, and I like the composition and the scene overall.</td>', 'Cute. I like how out-of-place the chairs seem, and I like the composition and the scene overall.', '2014-12-02 13:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
